#
# Encoding scope: one Deep Potential (DeepPot-SE) model for molten
# FLiBe + EuF2 trained on first-principles MD at three EuF2
# concentrations and used for large-scale DPMD across five
# concentrations at 823 K; reference settings, training settings and the
# test RMSEs in energy and force.

